The table inventories addresses and existing custody anchors; it does not consume every listed record as normative decision authority or refresh its product verification. Self-record anchors identify the preexisting declared purpose/module/owner. Capsule anchors cover small files; snapshots remain payload custody. These resolvable pointers establish address coverage, not an independent semantic ownership/contract/test/production audit. Normative source consumption for the new topology rule is separately traced in its pack and source records.

